%% Public edit rollback sequence
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber

  actor Caller as Application code
  participant API as CanvasEditPort
  participant EK as EditKernel
  participant Store as DocumentStoreKernel
  participant Selection as SelectionKernel
  participant Draft as DraftDocument
  participant Handle as CanvasEdit handle
  participant Touched as TouchedSet
  participant CC as CommitCompiler
  participant Effects as Buffered effects
  participant Signals as Public state/effects

  Caller->>API: edit(fn)
  API->>EK: open synchronous edit session
  EK->>EK: reject disposed or nested edit
  EK->>Store: read committed identity and revision snapshot
  Store-->>EK: committed tables and document revisions
  EK->>Selection: read selection snapshot for draft effects
  Selection-->>EK: selected ids and selectionRevision
  EK->>Draft: create rollback-safe draft
  EK->>Handle: bind live handle to session
  EK-->>Caller: invoke fn(handle)

  alt callback throws
    activate Handle
    Caller->>Handle: draft document/resource mutations and selection requests
    Handle->>Draft: mutate draft only
    Draft->>Touched: record exact mutation facts
    Caller--x EK: throw original exception
    deactivate Handle
    EK->>EK: capture original exception
  else callback returns Future
    Caller-->>EK: Future result
    EK->>EK: reject async edit before commit planning
    Note over EK: Returned Future is treated as a rollback path and no async mutation may outlive the session.
  else preflight fails before atomic install
    activate Handle
    Caller->>Handle: synchronous CanvasEdit mutations
    Handle->>Draft: mutate draft only
    Draft->>Touched: record exact mutation facts
    Handle-->>Caller: mutation results
    deactivate Handle
    Caller-->>EK: callback result
    EK->>EK: reject Future result before success path
    EK->>CC: compile touched set and invalidation candidates
    Touched-->>CC: exact changed state
    CC->>Store: preflight invariants
    Store--x CC: preflight error
    CC--x EK: rethrow preflight error
  end

  EK->>Effects: discard buffered events, repaint, resources, spatial, and projection effects
  EK->>Draft: discard draft
  EK->>Touched: discard touched set
  EK->>Handle: close session and mark handle stale
  Note over Handle: Any later handle operation throws StateError.
  Note over EK,Selection: Selection owner remains unchanged.
  Note over EK,Store: Committed document identity and document revisions remain unchanged. InteractionEngine-owned preview is outside Store.
  Note over Store,Signals: No atomic install runs and no action event, text edit event, public state publication, scene repaint, or overlay repaint is published.
  EK--x API: rethrow original exception, async edit rejection, or preflight error
  API--x Caller: propagate safely
